  "prompt": "深色橡木圆形种植盆，粗厚木板拼接盆壁，低多边形浅亮建筑场景风格；盆体木材仅使用#52362E和#714D48，木箍使用#8E664D；盆内清晰可见松散泥土，土壤仅使用#714D48和#8E664D，土面略低于盆沿且有轻微自然起伏；只有木盆和泥土，绝对不要植物、种子、嫩芽、叶片、花朵、苔藓、石头、标签或工具；底部平整，独立完整模型\nCoordinate contract: local Y+ is up, local Z+ is the front, entrance, or forward direction, and local X+ is right. Put doors, facades, openings, windshields, noses, seats, and other recognizable front details toward local Z+. For a modular repeated element, explicitly choose the long axis: side-by-side modules span local X with depth/front on local Z; traversal modules span local Z. Keep the model centered at its origin.\nCanonical dimensions contract: width=2.4, height=1.5, depth=2.4 world units. Keep the generated mesh within this centered bounding size.",
